    "notes": "Otosora · 音空 0.5.1\n\nFixes\n- Streamed songs were never counted as played. The player reports the same song again while a stream buffers, and each report restarted the count, so a song never reached its 30 seconds. Listening stats, \"Jump back in\" and \"Picked for you\" on the Stream home, and Autoplay's choices all depend on this count, so they fill in again as you listen.\n- Artist pages leave out hour-long compilations under Popular songs when there are enough real songs.\n\nEverything from 0.5.0 is included: the Stream home, artist and album pages, faster streams, the visualizer, and the updater fix.\n\nPick the APK for your phone. Most phones today use **arm64-v8a**.\n",
